&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our story unfolds in a small villiage in the mountains, where four men and five women cross paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The game is divided into four chapters, in a channel-surfing style adventure where each chapter has its own protaganist. The actions of the protaganist in one chapter has an effect on the protagonists of the other chapters.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Kokan Hunter ~Amai Fukurami~</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/10239/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Feb 2001 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/10239/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
